Please note that `PexObserve.ValueForViewing()`, `AssumePrecondition.IsTrue()` and `PexMethodAttribute` are not part of standard C#, they are custom Microsoft PEX assertion methods, you need to replace them with standard C# assertions.--------------------```cs
﻿// @@@ If the return value is false, last index of x in old arrList is <= index of x in new arrList
